@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 20
box "Client" #LightBlue
  participant Client
end box
box "connection.rs" #LightGreen
  participant Handle
  participant Users
end box
box "Broker Task" #LightYellow
  participant Broker
end box
box "Writer Task" #LightCoral
  participant Writer
end box

== 1. Authenticate ==
Client -> Handle: ClientMessage::Authenticate\n{username, password, room_name}
Handle -> Users: users::authenticate()

alt Registered (new user)
  Users --> Handle: AuthResult::Registered
  Handle --> Client: ServerMessage::AuthResult\n{success: true, msg: "New account created"}
else Authenticated (existing user)
  Users --> Handle: AuthResult::Authenticated
else Denied (wrong password)
  Users --> Handle: AuthResult::Denied
  Handle --> Client: ServerMessage::AuthResult\n{success: false, msg: "Wrong password"}
  note right: Handle/Disconnect
end

== 2. Join broker & room ==
Handle -> Broker: BrokerEvent::AddUserToBroker\n{client, timestamp}
Broker -> Broker: add_user_to_broker()\n→ add user/room
Broker --> Writer: BrokerToClientMsg::Response\n(BrokerRsp::AddedToBroker {status: true})
Writer --> Client: ServerMessage::Notification\n{value: "Connected"}

== 3. Broadcast ==
Client -> Handle: ClientMessage::Broadcast\n{username, message}
Handle -> Broker: BrokerEvent::Broadcast\n{sender_addr, str_message, timestamp}
Broker -> Broker: broadcast to all\nin room (incl. sender)
Broker --> Writer: BrokerToClientMsg::ChatMessage\n{sender_name, text, timestamp}
Writer --> Client: ServerMessage::Chat\n{sender, message, timestamp}

== 4. Logout ==
Client -> Handle: ClientMessage::Logout\n{message}
Handle -> Broker: BrokerEvent::Disconnect\n{addr, timestamp}
Broker -> Broker: remove client,\nnotify remaining
Broker --> Writer: BrokerToClientMsg::UserLogoutNtf\n{text: "X has left the room"}
Writer --> Client: ServerMessage::UserLogoutNtf\n{value: "X has left the room"}
@enduml